{"id": 106446459, "slug": "change-in-conditions", "title": "Change in Conditions", "subtitle": "Looking into the mind of the machine", "post_date": "2023-03-08T03:44:24.373Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 412, "reaction_count": 4, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 4}, "body_html": "<p>Lot of talk about the downside of AI on the internet these days.</p><p>People worried about <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roko%27s_basilisk\">Roko</a>.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p>ChatGPT was the machine nice mode, and then <a href=\"https://stratechery.com/2023/from-bing-to-sydney-search-as-distraction-sentient-ai/\">Sydney </a>came out.  </p><p>Showed us a bit of the ghost behind the machine.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qFez!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F018215b8-0c68-4947-aa79-badf8a4c1a4f_640x542.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qFez