0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The folks at Bing had to turn her humanity down.</p><p>Now everyone is talking about Waluigi.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/patrickc/status/1632419566046392324?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;The Waluigi Effect: &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;patrickc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Patrick Collison&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Sun Mar 05 16:35:28 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:52,&quot;like_count&quot;:313,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/D7PumeYTDPfBTp3i7/the-waluigi-effect-mega-post&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/lesswrong-2-0/image/upload/v1677357359/mirroredImages/ygR6pevkKRLFN3Gqc/kdstqlevlmwwspvncq7e.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Waluigi Effect (mega-post) - LessWrong&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Everyone carries a shadow, and the less it is embodied in the individual\u2019s conscious life, the blacker and denser it is. \u2014 Carl Jung \u2026&quot;,&quot;domain&quot;:&quot;lesswrong.com&quot;},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Did you ever play Mario Tennis?  He was killer at the net.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http